/Soccer_ball.jpg 1920w, https://connorsstate.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Soccer_ball-300x200.jpg 300w, https://connorsstate.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Soccer_ball-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://connorsstate.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Soccer_ball-768x512.jpg 768w, https://connorsstate.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Soccer_ball-1536x1023.jpg 1536w" sizes="(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px" /><span>Connors State College Names Steve Moore Men’s and Women’s Head Soccer Coach</span></a></h3></div>    </div>
